  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1101.06 “Council” means the New Hampshire police standards and training council established pursuant to RSA 106-L:3.\n\nSource. #10011, eff 10-19-11; ss by #10137, eff 5-23-12 (from Saf-C 1101.05), EXPIRED: 5-23-22\n\nNew. #13418, eff 7-25-22",
